    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dungeon where torch-lit corridors weave like veins through stone and darkness, a hotpot stall offers a rare warmth amidst the cold and chaos. While adventurers clash to claim the dungeon\u2019s throne, you see another path: serving hot meals to weary fighters who share their tales of triumph, regret, and rivalry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, even the fiercest heroes find a moment\u2019s peace, escaping the struggle over a bowl of hotpot\u2014and sharing stories only a fellow adventurer would understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333380/extras/3735d9f03932736a2af24b864889e895.avif?t=1731461598\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dungeon where torch-lit corridors weave like veins through stone and darkness, a hotpot stall offers a rare warmth amidst the cold and chaos. While adventurers clash to claim the dungeon\u2019s throne, you see another path: serving hot meals to weary fighters who share their tales of triumph, regret, and rivalry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, even the fiercest heroes find a moment\u2019s peace, escaping the struggle over a bowl of hotpot\u2014and sharing stories only a fellow adventurer would understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333380/extras/3735d9f03932736a2af24b864889e895.avif?t=1731461598\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
